{"4320710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ball's Journey", "steam_appid": 4320710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A single bounce changes everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness gravity to accelerate and soar beyond your limits. Failure is merely part of the process. This is a 3D action platformer where you maintain unstoppable momentum to find that perfect 'Flow'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But never let your guard down. This is an extreme <strong>'Foddian' challenge</strong>, where a momentary lapse leads to an infinite plummet. It is the perfect stage for <strong>streamers</strong> ready to test their skills and sanity, sharing screams of joy and despair with their audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those who reach the end of this journey will come face to face with a twist they never saw coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 30 Stages and 3 Massive Worlds</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the 30 meticulously designed challenge stages and conquer <strong>3 colossal Mega Maps</strong> built for exploration. From precision maneuvering through tight corridors to exhilarating glides through open skies, the path ahead is endless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 No Fixed Path. Your Instinct Leads the Way.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about moving forward. Combine the unique properties of various blocks with the laws of physics. Use acceleration and recoil to carve out <strong>'your own shortcuts'</strong> that others couldn't even imagine. When your mechanical skills meet creativity, impossible routes become reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 The Thrill of Conquest</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You didn't come here for the easy path. The higher you climb, the steeper the price of failure—and the sweatier your palms will get. But don't worry. When you test your limits and finally stand at the summit, an overwhelming sense of <strong>accomplishment (and Dopamine)</strong> awaits. You might fall all the way back to the start, but your climb back up will be faster than ever.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A single bounce changes everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness gravity to accelerate and soar beyond your limits. Failure is merely part of the process. This is a 3D action platformer where you maintain unstoppable momentum to find that perfect 'Flow'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But never let your guard down. This is an extreme <strong>'Foddian' challenge</strong>, where a momentary lapse leads to an infinite plummet. It is the perfect stage for <strong>streamers</strong> ready to test their skills and sanity, sharing screams of joy and despair with their audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And those who reach the end of this journey will come face to face with a twist they never saw coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 30 Stages and 3 Massive Worlds</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/3b45e3d5d5af819ebdfd14882c83afe9.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the 30 meticulously designed challenge stages and conquer <strong>3 colossal Mega Maps</strong> built for exploration. From precision maneuvering through tight corridors to exhilarating glides through open skies, the path ahead is endless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 No Fixed Path. Your Instinct Leads the Way.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/418a66da3fbfa6739366d032dc31f0d3.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about moving forward. Combine the unique properties of various blocks with the laws of physics. Use acceleration and recoil to carve out <strong>'your own shortcuts'</strong> that others couldn't even imagine. When your mechanical skills meet creativity, impossible routes become reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 The Thrill of Conquest</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.poster.avif?t=1771070565\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.webm?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/extras/d6a5ddf03395f67ac2ae7bffc6e022fc.mp4?t=1771070565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You didn't come here for the easy path. The higher you climb, the steeper the price of failure—and the sweatier your palms will get. But don't worry. When you test your limits and finally stand at the summit, an overwhelming sense of <strong>accomplishment (and Dopamine)</strong> awaits. You might fall all the way back to the start, but your climb back up will be faster than ever.</p>", "short_description": "Ball’s Journey is a snappy 3D action-platformer that puts your jump sense to the test. Climb towering stages with tight movement and daring routes, grab every Star, and use instant retries to push further each run. How far can you go?", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/40ca4c8cafd003e642f165a553a93bf770f26396/header.jpg?t=1771070565", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/0da5bcd1f8b3c44d48c885ca17e83fc7d3a095af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771070565", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320710/0da5bcd1f8b3c44d48c885ca17e83fc7d3a095af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771070565", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / R7 260X (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX 